    "lawCode": "Amd §§1, 2, 3 & 7, Chap 187 of 1960",
    "lawSection": "Volunteer and Exempt Firefighters' Benevolent Assoc., Inc.",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7555A\n\nSPONSOR: WEIK\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 187 of the laws of 1960 incorporating the West\nIslip Exempt Firemen's Benevolent Association, in relation to its\npurpose and the use of foreign fire insurance premium taxes\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 187 of the laws of 1960 incorporating the West\nIslip Exempt Firemen's Benevolent Association, in relation to its\npurpose and the use of foreign fire insurance premium taxes.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1. Sections 1, 2, 3 and 7 of chapter 187 of the laws of 1960\nincorporating the West Islip Exempt Firemen's Benevolent Association are\namended.\n\nSection 2: Sets the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nFirefighters put their life on the line every day and risk their lives\nto protect the people from a fire. The purpose of this bill is to\nprovide relief, aid and assistance to the volunteer members of such\ncorporation.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2024: A.10005 Reported referred to Rules\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately; provided, however, that the\namendments to section 7 of chapter 187 of the laws of 1960. made by\nsection one of this act shall apply to taxes due on premiums received on\nand after January 1, 2025.\n",
